    {
      "source": "<code>source</code> - the value to store. We might pass null, if your converter\nis not able to handle that, this is ok, we do handle <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/NullPointerException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>null pointer exceptions</code></a>",
